The `rangeSlider` widget reacts to `numericRefinements`. Here's an example with the `price` attribute:

```js
const search = instantsearch({
  indexName: 'instant_search',
  searchClient,
  searchParameters: {
    numericRefinements: {
      price: {
        '>=': [15],
        '<=': [115],
      },
    },
  },
});
```

Note that in the upcoming InstantSearch v4, this will be more straightforward with the concept of `uiState`:

```js
// Available from InstantSearch v4
const search = instantsearch({
  indexName: 'instant_search',
  searchClient,
  initialUiState: {
    range: {
      price: '15:115',
    },
  },
});
```
